    "detailed_description": "Tameshi is a vertical scrolling retro-style 2D shoot 'em up with colorful pixel-art graphics and an emphasis on manic action.<br><br>Engage single-player mode and take on the enemy hoards. Avoid taking fire to build your chain bonus!<br><br>Features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dozens of enemy types<br></li><li>7 stages to conquer<br></li><li>5 difficulty modes<br></li><li>Shot, laser and bomb weapons<br></li><li>Play with keyboard or gamepad<br></li><li>Unique Mini bosses<br></li><li>Formidable multi stage bosses<br></li><li>Powerful bolt on extras<br></li><li>Bullet hell sections<br></li><li>Explosions everywhere!<br></li><li>Steam cloud saves</li></ul><br>Note: the current version of Tameshi does NOT run on SteamDeck. We hope to resolve this issue in the future.",
    "about_the_game": "Tameshi is a vertical scrolling retro-style 2D shoot 'em up with colorful pixel-art graphics and an emphasis on manic action.<br><br>Engage single-player mode and take on the enemy hoards. Avoid taking fire to build your chain bonus!<br><br>Features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dozens of enemy types<br></li><li>7 stages to conquer<br></li><li>5 difficulty modes<br></li><li>Shot, laser and bomb weapons<br></li><li>Play with keyboard or gamepad<br></li><li>Unique Mini bosses<br></li><li>Formidable multi stage bosses<br></li><li>Powerful bolt on extras<br></li><li>Bullet hell sections<br></li><li>Explosions everywhere!<br></li><li>Steam cloud saves</li></ul><br>Note: the current version of Tameshi does NOT run on SteamDeck. We hope to resolve this issue in the future.",
    "short_description": "In this sideways scrolling shmup, take control of your spaceship and navigate through vibrant pixelated environments filled with hordes of enemy spacecraft. Power-up your ship and weapons, dodge enemy fire while blasting through each stage. Survive the onslaught and emerge victorious!",
